Third-party notice scope

The Lucide notice below applies to the Lucide-derived SVGs identified in
README.md as "Codex bundled Lucide". Their path geometry is unchanged; the
stroke width is adapted for optical consistency with the Codex light icon set.

Codex native SVGs and settings-component SVGs are separately identified by
source in README.md. They are not represented as Lucide-licensed assets.
HelloX brand assets and vendor brand assets are outside this directory.

